    "intro": "In Korean dream interpretation, a lightning dream is one of the most powerfully auspicious omens you can receive — even being struck dead by a thunderbolt is read as a sign of life transformation and rising fortune. But context matters enormously here: the same bolt of lightning that brings fortune in one dream can warn of danger in another. Here is how to read yours.",
