        "heading": "A Vivid, Full Rainbow — The Ultimate Good Omen",
        "content": "A clear, brightly colored rainbow stretching across the sky is among the most auspicious signs in Korean dream tradition. It foretells the fruition of long-cultivated efforts — positive news about exams, job applications, promotions, or business ventures is likely on its way. When the rainbow appears specifically after rain, the symbolism becomes even more powerful. Rain represents hardship and difficulty; the rainbow that follows represents recovery, blessing, and relief. If you have been going through a difficult period, this dream carries a direct message: the hard part is ending.\n\nDreams of walking on a rainbow or ascending along its arc amplify the meaning further — they point toward active wish fulfillment. For single dreamers, this often foreshadows meeting a compatible partner or news of a coming marriage. For career-focused individuals, it points toward a promotion, a rise in standing, or a significant professional breakthrough. A rainbow appearing over your home is read as a sign of domestic joy to come: a wedding in the family, a pregnancy, or the return of someone who has been far away — along with improving household finances.",
