    "intro": "In Korean dream interpretation, a tornado dream is one of the most charged symbols you can encounter — a raw signal that powerful, uncontrollable change is in motion. Here's the twist though: it isn't automatically a bad omen. Whether this dream is warning you or rallying you depends almost entirely on what happened to you inside the storm.",
