    "intro": "If you dreamed of a tree heavy with ripe, abundant fruit last night, Korean dream tradition has a clear message: the harvest you've been working toward is finally within reach. In Korean 꿈해몽 (dream interpretation), a fruit-laden tree is one of the most powerful auspicious omens, rooted in a cultural reverence for trees that stretches back to the founding myth of Korea itself — where the divine descended beneath a sacred tree to meet humanity. But here's the nuance worth knowing: the same tree dream can flip from fortune to warning depending entirely on the condition of the fruit.",
