verge in their positive valuation of this dream, even as they diverge in their explanatory framework. Korean tradition reads receiving flowers as a window into forthcoming events; Western psychology reads it as a mirror of the dreamer's inner emotional landscape. Both agree: this is a dream worth paying attention to.",
