eaning, while Western interpretation tends to emphasize renewal and hope. Korean 꿈해몽 is uniquely context-dependent: whether the blossoms are blooming or falling is the single most important variable — a level of interpretive nuance that Western dream analysis rarely applies to flower imagery.",
