    "conclusion": "Tree dreams in Korean tradition are one of the richest and most instructive categories in 해몽. Whether your tree was thriving or fallen, blooming or bare, each condition carries a specific message about the energy flowing through your life right now. A lush, fruit-laden tree is one of the finest affirmations the dreaming mind can offer. And even a fallen or dead tree — especially one that comes back to life — holds within it an extraordinary promise of reversal and renewal. Whatever your tree looked like, let its message guide you with clarity and confidence toward what matters most."
